      "title": "The Creation: The Twins and the Fracture",
      "type": "Myth",
      "categoryId": 2,
      "summary": "In the beginning there was nothing but twin gods, Order and Chaos. Their cooperation created the universe, the world, and life - and shattered them.",
      "body": "In the beginning there was nothing except twin siblings: [[Vaelos]] and [[Khavos]] aka the aspects of order and chaos.\n\n[[Vaelos]] attempted to create life, it was a timeless, beautiful and idyllic realm full of perfect geology, but nothing was alive in it. Life proved to be more chaotic than they could wrap their mind around. \n\n[[Khavos]], eager to prove they were the superior sibling, made a primal realm where all time existed at once, where void and light are in constant conflict, where opposites exist in the same space, and where fleshy mounds of biological goo heaved and pulsed, it was flesh without form and growth without pattern — it moved, but it did not live. Life required more systemic order than they could provide.\n\nDisappointed in their solo attempts, the siblings cooperated on the next attempt and created the universe, the world, and countless souls with their own will. But cooperating merged them into one [[United Being]]. Its creation succeeded — but the Being was too unstable to hold together, and within seconds it began to fracture. The first piece to break away was [[Time]], and it had to be: only once Time existed could anything happen one moment after another. Piece after piece followed in sequence, and thus the [[Shards]] came into being.\n\nWhat remains of that [[United Being]] still sits at the core of the world now after finding [[Equilibrium]], broken-off shards scattered from it, and it is the source of all magic.\n\nFrom the fracturing came a pantheon: [[Patrons | Patron]] shards of the [[Races]], aspects of the natural world such as [[Time]], [[Light and Dark]], a shard of divinity for each of the four [[Elements]] and minor shards down to the smallest local river spirit — each with its own personality and goals, sometimes cooperating, sometimes in conflict.\n\nThe sibling's first realms never went away. [[Aethelis, the Unchanging]] and [[Khavora, the Maelstrom Womb]] still exist, and they are the only two destinations for the dead. See [[The Two Afterlives]].",
